/Users/v/Code_2026/mopsus/doc/plans/2026-02-27-convergence-arbiter-design.md:12:The heated-debate system runs multi-round adversarial reviews (Contrarian → Reliability → Synthesis → Publish) using coding agents (Claude, Codex). Around round 5, agents exhibit **role drift** — they slide from discussing design plans into writing implementation code. This is a natural consequence of using code-optimized models: the impulse to *prove by implementation* is strong.
